Beyond.

64
00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:11.386
All right, next, a wedding conundrum.

65
00:02:11.386 --> 00:02:14.560
This comes to us from USA Today's advice column.

66
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:17.950
A soon to be bride writes that she and her fiance

67
00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.730
are planning an October wedding,

68
00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:23.050
because they wanted to do it in the Halloween style.

69
00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:24.860 line:15%
They're both gonna wear black,

70
00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.930 line:15%
but it turns out the bride's mom, not pleased.

71
00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:30.880 line:15%
Her father just wants her to be happy

72
00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:34.190 line:15%
but her mom is an old school, traditional Catholic

73
00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:36.967 line:15%
and is basically saying,

74
00:02:36.967 --> 00:02:38.620 line:15%
"I don't know if I can come to this wedding

75
00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:41.480 line:15%
if you do it this way, I might have to boycott

76
00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.430 line:15%
