79
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:50.790 line:15%
Oh, I'll tell you right now.

80
00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:51.870 line:15%
The mom is wrong.

81
00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:52.800
You're wrong.

82
00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:54.557
It's not your wedding.

83
00:02:54.557 --> 00:02:56.640
(audience applauds)

84
00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.230
Do you have children so that they can just live your life?

85
00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.280
No, you have them so they can live their life.

86
00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.140
So if she wants a freaky Halloween wedding,

87
00:03:03.140 --> 00:03:05.484
